AAPS implementation module - notices for ideas that came from elsewhere

CGM alarm engine (src/commonMain/kotlin/app/aaps/implementation/alerts/cgm/)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CgmAlarmEngine, CgmAlarmConditions, CgmAlarmKeys and CgmAlarmManager follow the
alarm engine of nightscout/AndroidAPS pull request 5397 (Dexcom G7 direct, by
t1dude), files G7Alarms.kt and G7AlarmEngine.kt at commit bec1b16ba20:
https://github.com/nightscout/AndroidAPS/pull/5397

That code was written for AndroidAPS and is under the same licence as
AndroidAPS (GNU Affero General Public License v3, see LICENSE.txt at the root
of this repository). The alarm types, the delay and repeat settings and the
acknowledge are taken from it, written again here as one layer for every BG
source. Its two open review points are fixed: an alarm repeats until it is
acknowledged (a dismissed notification is not an acknowledge), and the mute
timer can never silence urgent low.

The alarm sounds are Trio's, see core/ui/SOUNDS.md.
